@startuml COMP-SEQ03
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ03 UC03 创作者投稿与状态跟踪（组件级）

actor "创作者" as Creator
participant "VideoUploadPage" as Page
participant "videoApi / Axios" as Api
participant "Gin Router / AuthMiddleware" as Router
participant "UploadHandler" as Handler
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "本地文件系统" as FS
participant "FFmpeg / FFprobe" as FFmpeg
participant "CreatorDashboardPage" as Dashboard

Creator -> Page: 填写信息并选择视频、可选封面
Page -> Api: videoApi.upload(formData, progress, signal)
Api -> Router: POST /api/v1/videos/upload + Bearer Token
Router -> Handler: UploadHandler(context)
Handler -> Handler: 校验标题并读取 multipart 文件
Handler -> FS: 保存用户临时文件
Handler -> DB: Create(Video{status: pending})
DB --> Handler: video.id
Handler -> FS: 创建视频目录并移动源文件
opt 提供封面
  Handler -> FS: 保存封面文件
  Handler -> DB: Update cover_url
end
Handler -> FFmpeg: 异步 transcodeVideoAsync(...)
Handler --> Api: 返回 pending 视频
Api --> Page: 显示上传完成
FFmpeg -> FS: 生成 HLS、缩略图并读取时长
FFmpeg -> DB: 更新 video_url、duration、cover_url

Creator -> Dashboard: 查看或筛选投稿状态
Dashboard -> Api: videoApi.myVideos(params)
Api -> Router: GET /api/v1/users/me/videos
Router -> DB: MeVideosHandler 查询当前用户作品
DB --> Dashboard: 投稿分页列表与状态
@enduml
